> You can't say it's not[ thoroughly] deserved. Two impressive achievements by Claudio Marchisio rightly called for a standing ovation from the Juventus Stadium faithful before the[ match] against Cagliari. And Il[ Princ]ipino[ duly] collected two awards for his efforts following the pre-[match] warm-up.
First there was a[ commemor]ative plaque for his 300th[ Bian]coneri appearance – which came against[ Fi]orentina last week – handed to him by president Andrea Agnelli.
Then it was time for J-Member Martina Divis to hand him the MVP of the Month Powered By Hanwha award for April on behalf of the Juventus Membership community.
A memorable night for Marchisio and an[ unforgettable] one for Martina, who got to meet one of her heroes while soaking up the pre-match[ atmosphere] on the hallowed J-Stadium turf.
Next time you could be the lucky J-Member doing the honours! You just need to go to the ON THE PITCH > F[ixtures] and Results section and vote for your man of the[ match] after every game.
If you haven't joined the JuventusMembership family yet, don't delay: do it today! For more[ details], see here. #WeAreOne!

