=== Text #15 ===
> From the makers of Star[bound], Wargroove by Chuckle[fish] arrives on PC, Nintendo[ Switch], and Xbox One on February 1st, 2019.[ Coming] soon to PlayStation 4.
London, England – January 23, 2019. Chuckle[fish] LTD. – Chuckle[fish] is proud to announce that the wait for Wargroove is[ finally] over with a launch date of February 1st on PC, Nintendo[ Switch], and Xbox[ One], priced at £15.99 / $19.99 / 16.99€, and available to play in 10 languages. Don’t[ worry] PlayStation 4 fans, Wargroove will also be making its way to the platform soon!
The news was announced via Nintendo Europe’s Indie[ Highlights Show]case, where it also[ revealed] the Wargroove announcement[ trailer] featuring an incredible animation from the London-based animation studio, The Line. Wargroove is available to pre-purchase and pre-download on Nintendo[ Switch] now, and open to wishlisting on Steam.

